==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*solh₂-}}
From {{suffix|en|hole|on}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|particle}} One of three kinds of [[quasiparticle]] (the others being the [[spinon]] and [[orbiton]]) that [[electron]]s in [[solid]]s are able to split into during the process of spin–charge separation, when extremely tightly confined at temperatures close to absolute zero.
#: {{syn|en|chargon}}

